:: MP Keepsake Use Whistle 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Weather.precipitation is "rain">>海雾深锁的雾角灯塔顶层露台外，<<else>>海风猎猎的雾角灯塔回音廊尽头，<</if>>你取出守塔人铜哨对准外海古航标石柱吹出三短一长的归航讯号。铜哨管身中段套着一圈可调节音高与折射角度的黄铜副环。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_whistle_3 is 1>>
守塔人铜哨今日已与外海古航标共鸣过，哨管尚存海风微凉。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "吹响归航音 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-3">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 430 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_whistle_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_whistle_3")>><<money 420>>古航标石柱底部的潮汐机括应声开启，吐出一匣封存的远洋航海银币。<<else>>古航标石柱底部的潮汐机括应声开启，哨音与海浪共鸣不息。<</if>><span class="green">守塔人铜哨唤醒了外海古航标暗格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海风逆灌进铜哨音孔，震得你唇角发麻。<span class="red">你侧身背对海风平复呼吸。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[矮身再吹响归航音 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link "旋环折音 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_whistle_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_whistle_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>折射哨音精准传入礁石盲区，暗龛石门滑开，露出守塔人珍藏的信物铜牌。<<else>>折射哨音精准传入礁石盲区，暗龛石门滑开后露出平整的石槽。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">声学折射让守塔人铜哨发挥了真正妙用。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	回音壁角度偏了半寸，共鸣声散在海浪里。<span class="red">你对准石拱焦点准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[敛息再旋环折音 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<windowicon>><<link [[继续查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Core 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>深夜寂静的机括城停摆天文台内，<<else>>机括城中央星象沙盘的副轴座前，<</if>>你将蓝钢怀表芯嵌入十二宫副轴的校准孔，测试整座天球仪的联动齿比。校准孔外围刻着一圈精细的十二宫齿比刻度盘，主卡槽就在正中央。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_core_3 is 1>>
蓝钢怀表芯今日已完成十二宫副轴联动校准，星轨运转分毫不差。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-core-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "推入表芯 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_core_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_core_3")>><<money 420>>蓝钢游丝与主轴瞬间同步，沙盘底座弹出一只装满机括城纪念银币的铜盒。<<else>>蓝钢游丝与主轴瞬间同步，沙盘齿轮发出清脆悦耳的运转声。<</if>><span class="green">蓝钢怀表芯完美激活了星象副轴。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	副轴棘爪回弹了一下，震痛了你的食指指尖。<span class="red">你拨开止逆爪准备重新嵌入。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压手再推入表芯 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpastroicon>><<link "拨动刻度 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core-3">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_core_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_core_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>齿轮咬合声清脆悦耳，底座暗抽屉缓缓滑出，奉上一卷工程纪念母模。<<else>>齿轮咬合声匀净轻快，沙盘底座的暗抽屉顺滑地弹开归位。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">精准计算让蓝钢怀表芯严丝合缝地啮合。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回齿轮回廊 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	刻度盘内圈积着少许油泥，转到半途卡了一下。<span class="red">你擦净油泥准备再次拨盘。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沉肩再拨动刻度 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[继续查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Ring 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>幽暗的地下古修道院灰烬藏经阁深处，<<else>>长明灯摇曳的古修道院藏经阁石台前，<</if>>你将银鸽指环按进泥金秘典封面的橄榄枝凹槽。凹槽底部封着一层陈年蜂蜡锁，旁边石灯的火苗正散发着微温。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_ring_3 is 1>>
银鸽指环的羽翼印记今日已开启过秘典铜扣，藏经阁内檀香静谧。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "嵌入指环 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-3">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_ring_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_ring_3")>><<money 420>>秘典铜扣应声弹开，夹层里露出一叠古修道院奉纳银券与密文抄页。<<else>>秘典铜扣应声弹开，内页的古修道院密文在灯下清晰可辨。<</if>><span class="green">银鸽指环开启了泥金秘典的封存夹层。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜扣内侧簧片紧绷，按压时硌红了你的指节。<span class="red">你揉了揉指节准备垂直发力。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[俯身再嵌入指环 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<caveicon "torch">><<link "烘开蜂蜡 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_ring_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_ring_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>微温的银鸽指环融开陈年蜂蜡，秘典内页的奉纳纪念铜牌完好呈现在眼前。<<else>>微温的银鸽指环融开残存蜂蜡，秘典夹层顺畅地展现在眼前。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">温热银鸽指环无损解开了蜂蜡暗锁。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回静默石阶 (0:08)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	灯火距离稍远，指环温度还没烘够。<span class="red">你凑近长明灯焰心再烘片刻。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凝神再烘开蜂蜡 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[继续查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Amber 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声淅沥的秘密温室地下酿造室里，<<else>>恒温幽静的秘密温室标本廊深处，<</if>>你旋开琥珀香膏瓶的鎏金内盖，将其凑近一株闭合的千年夜光银脉兰。瓶盖内侧插着一枚挑香膏用的纯银细挑针。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_amber_3 is 1>>
琥珀香膏瓶今日已催开过那株夜光银脉兰，幽香仍在玻璃罩内流转。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "挑出香膏 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-3">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_amber_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_amber_3")>><<money 420>>银脉兰花瓣缓缓舒展，花心托出一枚早年庄园主留下的纯金花蕊章与赏金。<<else>>银脉兰花瓣缓缓舒展，花心在夜光琥珀的映照下泛起柔光。<</if>><span class="green">琥珀香膏瓶唤醒了千年银脉兰。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回温室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	花萼外侧凝着冷露，香膏滑落了一小滴。<span class="red">你先用吸水纸拭干花萼冷露。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[蹲身再挑出香膏 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回温室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<gardenicon "water">><<link "温香熏兰 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-3">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_amber_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_amber_3_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>温润甜香笼罩花冠，夜光兰吐露芳华，底座暗格随之弹出育种纪念胸针。<<else>>温润甜香笼罩花冠，夜光兰吐露芳华，叶片显得愈发莹润挺拔。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">熏香之法让银脉兰毫无损伤地盛放。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回兰花厅 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	温水皿水温稍低，香气散得慢了些。<span class="red">你添入少许热水准备重新熏香。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺势再温香熏兰 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回温室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<farmicon "lab">><<link [[继续查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Medal 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>夜色下的黑铁货运站信号塔顶层，<<else>>黑铁货运站地下走私月台的主控箱前，<</if>>你取出站长纪念铜章，对准联锁机箱侧面的八角母槽按了下去。母槽下方的面板上并排立着三根带刻度的联锁小拉杆。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_medal_3 is 1>>
站长纪念铜章今日已开启过联锁机箱副格，信号灯静静闪烁。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "拧入铜章 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_medal_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_medal_3")>><<money 420>>八角母槽转动半圈，机箱底层弹出一盒早期铁路押运银币。<<else>>八角母槽随铜章转动半圈，信号机箱底层的联锁簧稳稳归位。<</if>><span class="green">站长纪念铜章打开了信号塔备用金匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
	母槽内有铁锈阻滞，拧动时震麻了手腕。<span class="red">你拍散槽内铁锈准备再拧。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦手再拧入铜章 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<crimeicon "black box">><<link "拨齐拉杆 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_medal_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_medal_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>三根联锁拉杆齐齐落位，机箱侧门自动弹开，露出里面的铁路信物铜牌券。<<else>>三根联锁拉杆齐齐落位，机箱侧门顺畅弹开，传动轴运转如常。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你破译站长纪念铜章刻痕解开了联锁箱。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回机车侧线 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
	第二根拉杆弹簧略紧，没能一次拉到位。<span class="red">你双手握住拉杆准备重新对齐。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏息再拨齐拉杆 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<techicon "lightbulb">><<link [[继续查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Antler 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Weather.precipitation is "rain">>夜雾缭绕的古德鲁伊石环月泉祭坛前，<<else>>林间清光洒落的古德鲁伊石环主柱下，<</if>>你举起白鹿角坠饰，让坠饰尖端的螺旋纹对准月泉出水口的石雕鹿首。鹿角坠饰侧面钻有一枚细小的破雾音孔，吹气即可发出清越鹿鸣。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3 is 1>>
白鹿角坠饰今日已引动过月泉石雕暗流，泉水清冽甘甜。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "嵌入鹿角 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-3">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3")>><<money 420>>清泉改道冲开石池暗龛，浮出一只装满古德鲁伊奉纳银币的柏木盒。<<else>>清泉顺着鹿角凹槽改道流入石池，水面泛起一圈圈澄澈涟漪。<</if>><span class="green">白鹿角坠饰开启了月泉祭坛的水下暗龛。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回古石环 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	泉水冰冷激手，坠饰在湿石上滑脱半寸。<span class="red">你擦干石鹿额心水渍准备再嵌。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓步再嵌入鹿角 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回古石环 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link "吹响鹿角 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-3">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 430 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_antler_3_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>悠远鹿鸣在石柱群间回荡，树根石台缓缓裂开一道缝隙，露出古币与灵草。<<else>>悠远鹿鸣在石柱群间回荡，树根石台的暗缝随之缓缓开启。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">鹿鸣清音唤醒了石环古老的馈赠。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回石柱群 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	林间山风吹散了尾音，石台只轻轻颤了一下。<span class="red">你等阵风过去准备再吹一次。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[贴近再吹响鹿角 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回古石环 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[继续查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Mask 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>华灯璀璨的峭壁天鹅绒暗层拍卖厅后廊，<<else>>幽静奢华的天鹅绒暗层贵宾画廊里，<</if>>你将纯银狐面胸针别在领口，走近那扇只对核心假面会员敞开的紫檀暗门。胸针背面设有双层暗针，暗门锁孔上方正映着一束微弱的折光斑。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3 is 1>>
纯银狐面胸针今日已为你开启过紫檀密室，暗香在衣领间萦绕。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "对准光斑 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-3">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3")>><<money 420>>胸针银面将壁灯光束折射入暗锁，紫檀门无声滑开，桌上放着一匣贵宾红利筹码。<<else>>胸针银面将壁灯光束折射入暗锁，紫檀暗门悄无声息地滑开。<</if>><span class="green">纯银狐面胸针为你打开了核心贵宾室。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回暗层 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	壁灯光线角度略偏，光斑差了半寸才照进锁孔。<span class="red">你微调胸针倾角准备重新对光。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶墙再对准光斑 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回暗层 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link "拨开暗针 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_mask_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>双层暗针精准顶开内簧，密室小格弹出，你将里面的不记名贵宾铜牌收入怀中。<<else>>双层暗针精准顶开内簧，密室小格顺畅弹出，锁芯分毫无损。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你巧用胸针背面的暗针开启了密室金格。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	暗针纤细富有弹性，插入时指尖微微一抖。<span class="red">你扶住门框稳住手指准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫布再拨开暗针 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回暗层 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[继续查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Lens 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>星光透过旧学园天文翼楼的折光穹顶，<<else>>天光映照的旧学园天文翼楼星图室里，<</if>>你将消色差古透镜装入主赤道仪的副寻星镜筒，对准钟塔尖顶的刻度盘。寻星镜筒下方的星图匣封着一枚感光火漆，借透镜聚光即可将其烘软。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_lens_3 is 1>>
消色差古透镜今日已校准过钟塔尖顶暗记，镜片澄澈透亮。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-3">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "旋动透镜 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_lens_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_lens_3")>><<money 420>>极远处的微雕暗码在视场中纤毫毕现，赤道仪底座随之弹出一匣研究奖学金。<<else>>极远处的微雕暗码在视场中纤毫毕现，赤道仪刻度对得严丝合缝。<</if>><span class="green">消色差古透镜助你破译了钟塔远距暗码。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	高处云影掠过遮住了光线，视场一时模糊。<span class="red">你等云影散开准备重新调焦。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓气再旋动透镜 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpastroicon>><<link "烘化火漆 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-3">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKsUse3_mp_keepsake_use_lens_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks_use3_rew_mp_keepsake_use_lens_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>聚焦光斑温热融开感光火漆，抽屉无声滑开，露出一叠早期学园基金纪念铜牌。<<else>>聚焦光斑温热融开残蜡，底座抽屉无声滑开，铜轨光洁如新。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">聚焦光斑巧妙解开了星图桌的火漆暗屉。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	焦点距离差了一分，火漆只微微变软。<span class="red">你调整透镜高度准备重新聚光。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凝目再烘化火漆 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[继续查探(0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
